{% comment %}
  Quiz Funnel 2 — Steps 8-10 (Emotional Depth Questions)
  Step 8: Partner Impact
  Step 9: Biggest Fear / Mirror
  Step 10: Drive Level Rating
{% endcomment %}

<!-- STEP 8: PARTNER IMPACT -->
<div class="qf-step" data-step="8">
  <button class="qf-back" onclick="qfGoBack(8)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg></button>
  <h2 class="qf-q">How has this been affecting your relationship?</h2>
  <p class="qf-sub">She may not be saying it out loud. But you can feel the distance.</p>
  <div class="qf-opts">
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Patient" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,8)"><div class="qf-opt__label">🛡️ She's patient — for now</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Pull away" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,8)"><div class="qf-opt__label">🫶 She's starting to pull away and I feel it</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Frustrated" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,8)"><div class="qf-opt__label">💔 I can tell she's frustrated, even if she won't say it</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Argued" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,8)"><div class="qf-opt__label">🧊 We've argued about intimacy more than once</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Scared" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,8)"><div class="qf-opt__label">😨 I'm scared of what happens if nothing changes</div></button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- STEP 9: BIGGEST FEAR / MIRROR -->
<div class="qf-step" data-step="9">
  <button class="qf-back" onclick="qfGoBack(9)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg></button>
  <h2 class="qf-q">When you look in the mirror, do you still see the man you were 5 years ago?</h2>
  <p class="qf-sub">This isn't about looks. It's about the energy and presence you used to carry into every room.</p>
  <div class="qf-opts">
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Yes - sharp" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,9)"><div class="qf-opt__label">💯 Yes — I still feel sharp and in control</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Mostly" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,9)"><div class="qf-opt__label">🤔 Mostly — something's a bit different but I manage</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="No - bothers me" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,9)"><div class="qf-opt__label">📉 Honestly, no — I can see the change and it bothers me</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Stopped looking" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,9)"><div class="qf-opt__label">😨 I stopped looking too closely a while ago</div></button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- STEP 10: DRIVE LEVEL (Direct) -->
<div class="qf-step" data-step="10">
  <button class="qf-back" onclick="qfGoBack(10)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg></button>
  <h2 class="qf-q">How would you rate your natural drive and morning energy right now?</h2>
  <p class="qf-sub">No judgment. No right or wrong answer. Just the raw truth.</p>
  <div class="qf-opts">
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="5" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,10)">
      <div class="qf-opt__txt"><div class="qf-opt__label">5 Strong and consistent</div><div class="qf-opt__desc">I feel like myself</div></div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="4" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,10)">
      <div class="qf-opt__txt"><div class="qf-opt__label">4 Decent on good days</div><div class="qf-opt__desc">But not what it was</div></div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="3" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,10)">
      <div class="qf-opt__txt"><div class="qf-opt__label">3 Hit or miss</div><div class="qf-opt__desc">I never know what I'll wake up to</div></div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="2" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,10)">
      <div class="qf-opt__txt"><div class="qf-opt__label">2 Barely there</div><div class="qf-opt__desc">I'm going through the motions</div></div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="1" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,10)">
      <div class="qf-opt__txt"><div class="qf-opt__label">1 Basically gone</div><div class="qf-opt__desc">I can't remember the last time I felt it</div></div>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
